# Architecture

Keep module boundaries explicit and dependency direction simple.
Prefer the smallest design meeting docs/PRD.md. Record consequential tradeoffs in docs/DECISIONS.md.
For example, keep payment-provider calls behind a service boundary rather than scattering them through UI code.
